    "iCloud Driveの他端末への配信はOSが行います。フォルダーへ保存できても、他端末へ到着するまで時間がかかる場合があります。履歴は自動削除しません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Native UI copy; English fallback until a locale-specific translation is available.",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "The OS distributes iCloud Drive files to other devices. Even after files are saved to the folder, they may take time to reach other devices. History is not deleted automatically."
