    "モデル切替時は保存済み設定を復元します。モデルに応じて出力上限を調整し、非対応モデルではストリーミングを使いません。ローカル実行は端末内のモデルファイルを使用します。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Native UI copy; English fallback until a locale-specific translation is available.",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Switching models restores saved settings. Output limits are adjusted for the model, and streaming is disabled for models that do not support it. Local execution uses model files on this device."
          }
