    "会話と子フォルダは親フォルダへ移ります。親がない場合は未所属・最上位になります。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Native UI copy; English fallback until a locale-specific translation is available.",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Conversations and subfolders move to the parent folder. If there is no parent, conversations become unfiled and subfolders move to the top level."
