    "元の会話から選択範囲を取り除きます。範囲外の子や後続は残ります。保護されたメッセージを含む場合は操作を行いません。ピン留めは操作を防ぎません。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "comment": "Native UI copy; English fallback until a locale-specific translation is available.",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Removes the selected range from the original conversation. Children and subsequent messages outside the range are retained. No action is taken if the range includes protected messages. Pinning does not prevent this action."
